body.push(H1("Data and Code Availability"));
body.push(P("The UNSW-NB15 partition files used in this study were obtained from the Zenodo record with DOI 10.5281/zenodo.3768048 [35], a third-party redistribution. The official dataset is described and distributed by UNSW Canberra [36]. Section 4.2 reports the checksum and content checks against both sources. The experiment code, per-run result files, and analysis scripts are not publicly deposited at the time of writing. For this revision the experiment was re-run from the downloaded files (Section 4.8). Tables 7 to 11 and Figures 2 to 4 were regenerated from the original per-run result files, Tables 12 to 14 and Figure 5 were generated from the extension's runs, including the addendum runs of M1-seq, and Table 15 from the perturbation measurements. These records are not public, so the statements in this paper about reproduction can be checked only by the authors at present."));
